er":false,"text":"One of the big three and daughter of a huge enterprise which is also the largest supporter of Garasunomiya school. She meets Saruyoshi when dying of boredom on hospital bed. Moved by his hot feeling and passion, she decides to help him with his ambition because it seems interesting. While Saruyoshi dresses up as a girl and go to Garasunomiya all-girls school, she also disguises as a boy to attend his all-boys school to get to know about boy."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c98073"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"名家のお嬢様。 礼儀、礼節、マナーを完璧にこなす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で、名家の生まれであることを窮屈に感じている節もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・猿吉に化粧をほどこし、女子校へと手引き、男としてバレないようサポートしてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"読書家。糖分がないと思考力を保つことができない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23543","sourceWorkId":"31276","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"名家のお嬢様。 礼儀、礼節、マナーを完璧にこなす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で、名家の生まれであることを窮屈に感じている節もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・猿吉に化粧をほどこし、女子高へと手引き、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男としてバレないようサポートしてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"読書家。糖分がないと思考力を保つことができない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"97656"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"97656","value":"さざ波"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37e228c508ea618c2b5261247ca99a4e5830714f7703e4373fa2133597be490e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5bf876437d4d611b790cc08c52597477dce0dd52e4a7a4f3671fe29c7955fa65.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大地葉","creatorId":"vndb:s10070","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10070","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10070","name":"大地 葉","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:322778:97656:10869:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c98074","charac